Package: kpdrive
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: kwalletmanager | gnome-keyring, kdialog, wl-clipboard
Description: Proton Drive sync client for KDE Plasma
 kpdrive keeps a local folder in step with Proton Drive, in both directions
 and end to end encrypted. It runs as a daemon with a Plasma tray icon,
 creates public links, downloads the Photos timeline, and honours a
 .protonignore file.
 .
 This package holds the command line tool and the sync daemon.

Package: kpdrive-ui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         kpdrive (= ${binary:Version}),
         qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami
Description: Proton Drive account and log window
 A Kirigami window showing the signed-in account, storage in use, the sync
 folder, and the activity log with search and a retention setting.

Package: kpdrive-dolphin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, kpdrive (= ${binary:Version})
Enhances: dolphin
Description: Proton Drive integration for Dolphin
 Overlay icons marking which files in the sync folder are up to date, and a
 "Copy Proton Drive link" entry in the context menu.
